  "question": {
    "text": "For the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></math>, at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>, is equal to ________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So on putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now, differentiating the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Again, Diff.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;w.r.t.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So, value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}